# AI cost control

Collect → normalize → dedup → filter → cluster → deterministic context →
materiality gate → analyze material events only. Skip analysis when the
agent's daily token budget is exhausted; leave the event `needs_analysis`.
Cache by model, schema, prompt, and context hash. Persist usage. Do not send
raw hit dumps to an expensive model.
